{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpi",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Findings",
                  "field": "finding_count",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "unused_layout",
                      "params": {
                        "ddr": ""
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Without DDR info",
                  "field": "low_confidence_count",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "unused_layout",
                      "params": {
                        "ddr": "without"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "In the layout menu",
                  "field": "entry_point_count",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Affected files",
                  "field": "affected_files",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "findings_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Unused Layout",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "findings"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "findings_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": true,
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search file or name…",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "file_name",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "object_name",
                  "label": "Name"
                },
                {
                  "field": "reason_status",
                  "label": "Status",
                  "nowrap": true,
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "unused": "Unused",
                    "unused_unverified": "Unused (unverified)"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "low_confidence",
                  "label": "Without DDR info",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "true": "Yes",
                    "false": "No"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "Layout"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No unused layout found."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "entry_points_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Entry points: in the layout menu, no navigation",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "entry_points"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "entry_points_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": true,
              "pageParam": "entry_page",
              "searchParam": "entry_q",
              "sortParam": "entry_sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search file or name…",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "file_name",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "object_name",
                  "label": "Name"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "Layout"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No entry point found."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "notes_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "What the status means"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "notes_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "**Unverified.** The file was exported without DDR info. It then carries no references from formulas at all — a use in a calculation stays invisible. Such a finding reads *Unused (unverified)*; the tile *Without DDR info* lists them. Export the file again with DDR info before deleting anything.\n\n**Entry points.** A layout in the layout menu can be opened by the user even when nothing navigates to it. It is not a finding; the list *Entry points* shows it. If it is not meant to be opened, remove it from the layout menu — then it becomes a finding.\n\n**Limits.** Only usage inside the imported solution counts. Not visible: **calls from outside** — server schedules, Data API, OData, `fmp://` URLs, AppleScript/ActiveX, plug-ins, files that were not imported; **dynamic references inside** — *Perform Script* by name, `GetField`, `Evaluate`, names inside SQL strings. A finding is a review candidate, not a delete recommendation. [How usage is counted](/docs/fm-lab/schema/schema%2FUsage%20and%20References)"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
